
This file does not concern specifically to Animation, Service, Spec, Stats or Type.

AnimationLayer -> Enum that says the "impact" of the animation in the model.
    -> BASE: Full body animation, the model is ALWAYS with one of these active.
    -> UPPER: Upper body animation, can happen concurrently with BASE.
    -> ADDITIVE: Micro effects that go on op of the others.
    -> Example: the player is always idle, walking, running or dying, ALWAYS, this is the base animation. The player MIGHT
    attack WHILE having base as walking or in any other animation, meaning that the model can attack while walking.
    Additionally, the model might have heavy breathing or respiration, these animations come here.





















